<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Antarctica · bitcoin++ Expeditions</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/antarctica.css?v=payment-prices-1"><script src="/static/js/antarctica.js?v=payment-prices-1" defer></script></head>
<body class="antarctica">
<div class="draft-banner">{{ if .Preview }}Private design preview{{ else }}Expedition preview{{ end }} · Reservations are not open</div>
<header><a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="bitcoin++">bitcoin<span>++</span></a><span class="edition">EXPEDITIONS / ANTARCTICA</span><nav aria-label="Expedition"><a href="#journey">The journey</a><a href="#berths">Your berth</a><a href="#parka">The parka</a><a href="/dashboard">Your account ↗</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A gathering at the edge of the map</p><h1>To the end<br>of the <em>earth.</em></h1><p class="hero-deck">Bitcoin. Big ideas.<br>An entirely different latitude.</p><a class="button" href="#berths">Explore the expedition <span>↓</span></a><div class="hero-facts"><span>ANTARCTICA</span><span>{{ if and .Conf .Conf.DateDesc }}{{ .Conf.DateDesc }}{{ else }}January 24–February 5, 2028{{ end }}</span></div></div><figure><img src="/static/img/antarctica/expedition.svg" alt="Illustrated expedition ship beneath an Antarctic mountain range and a golden sun"><figcaption>Southward, together. / Expedition concept illustration</figcaption></figure><div class="hero-seal" aria-hidden="true">₿<small>BEYOND<br>THE ORDINARY</small></div></section>
<section id="journey" class="journey section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / The journey</p><h2>A little further<br>from the familiar.</h2></div><div class="journey-body"><p class="lede">A <span class="wordmark brand-inline">bitcoin<span>++</span></span> conference with an expedition at its heart. A place for conversations that deserve more than a hallway.</p><p>Bring your curiosity. We’re shaping a journey around shared exploration, technical discussion, and time together.</p><div class="itinerary"><div><span>01</span><h3>Gather</h3><p>Departure port and arrival arrangements to be announced.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Explore</h3><p>The sailing route, daily itinerary, and conference sessions are being planned.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Return</h3><p>Onward travel details to follow.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="people" class="people section"><p class="eyebrow">02 / The company you keep</p><h2>Good minds.<br>Extraordinary surroundings.</h2>{{ if .Speakers }}<div class="speaker-grid">{{ range .Speakers }}<a href="{{ speakerPublicPath . }}">{{ if .Photo }}<img src="{{ speakerPhoto .Photo }}" alt="">{{ end }}<h3>{{ .Name }}</h3><p>{{ .Company }}</p></a>{{ end }}</div>{{ else }}<p class="lede">Our first speakers and expedition hosts will be announced here.</p>{{ end }}</section>
<section id="berths" class="section berths"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Find your berth</p><h2>Make room<br>for an adventure.</h2><p>Prices in USD, per person. Inclusions, tax treatment, and booking terms are being finalized.</p></div><div class="berth-grid">{{ range .Berths }}<article><span class="eyebrow">{{ .Name }}</span><h3>{{ .Price }}<small>USD / PERSON</small></h3><p>{{ .Description }}</p><div class="deposit"><span>20% reservation deposit</span><strong>{{ .Deposit }}</strong></div><a class="text-link" href="#payment-options" data-berth-select="{{ .ID }}">Explore payment options ↗</a></article>{{ end }}</div></section>
<section id="payment-options" class="payments section"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / Plan your passage</p><h2>More than one<br>way south.</h2><label class="berth-picker">YOUR BERTH<select id="berth-choice">{{ range .Berths }}<option value="{{ .ID }}" data-price-cents="{{ .PriceCents }}" data-deposit="{{ .Deposit }}" data-contribution="{{ .BitcoinContribution }}" data-reservation="{{ .ReservationCost }}" data-held="{{ .HeldBitcoinValue }}">{{ .Name }} — {{ .Price }}</option>{{ end }}</select></label></div><div class="payment-visuals">
  <figure class="payment-timeline">
    <figcaption><span class="eyebrow">Compare your commitments</span><h3>The payment plan, at a glance.</h3><p>Five equal payments. One fixed fare.</p></figcaption>
    <ol class="installment-chart" aria-label="Five equal payments of twenty percent">
      <li><span class="timeline-share">20%</span><span class="timeline-date">Reserve<span>Your deposit</span></span><strong data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</strong></li>
      <li><span class="timeline-share">20%</span><span class="timeline-date">Jan 1<span>2027</span></span><strong data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</strong></li>
      <li><span class="timeline-share">20%</span><span class="timeline-date">Apr 1<span>2027</span></span><strong data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</strong></li>
      <li><span class="timeline-share">20%</span><span class="timeline-date">Jul 1<span>2027</span></span><strong data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</strong></li>
      <li><span class="timeline-share">20%</span><span class="timeline-date">Oct 1<span>2027</span></span><strong data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</strong></li>
    </ol>
  </figure>
  <div class="bitcoin-explorer" id="bitcoin-explorer" hidden>
    <div class="scenario-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Explore the bitcoin option</p><h3>What if bitcoin changes?</h3><p>You contribute 75% upfront: 25% of the fare reserves your space, while bitcoin initially worth 50% of the fare stays invested.</p><p>The held bitcoin must cover the remaining 75% of your fare at settlement.</p><div class="btc-price-inputs"><label for="bitcoin-price-now">BTC price today / at deposit (USD)<input type="number" id="bitcoin-price-now" min="1" max="1000000000" step="0.01" value="100000" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="bitcoin-price-future">Your BTC price scenario · Oct 1, 2027 (USD)<input type="number" id="bitcoin-price-future" min="0" max="1000000000" step="0.01" value="100000" inputmode="decimal"></label></div><button type="button" class="spot-price-button" id="bitcoin-spot">Use current BTC price</button><p id="bitcoin-price-source" class="price-source" aria-live="polite">Starting example: $100,000 per BTC, not a live quote. Enter prices or load the current spot price.</p><p id="bitcoin-price-error" role="alert" hidden>Enter a deposit price from $1 to $1 billion and an October price from $0 to $1 billion.</p><label for="bitcoin-change">Bitcoin price change by October 1, 2027 <output id="bitcoin-change-label" for="bitcoin-change">0%</output></label><input type="range" id="bitcoin-change" min="-100" max="200" step="5" value="0" aria-describedby="bitcoin-scenario-note"><div class="range-labels" aria-hidden="true"><span>−100%</span><span>+200%</span></div></div>
    <figure class="scenario-figure" id="bitcoin-scenario-results"><figcaption>Held bitcoin vs. remaining fare <span>USD · before taxes and fees</span></figcaption>
      <div class="scenario-bar-row"><div><span>Held bitcoin at settlement</span><strong id="scenario-held">$8,214.50</strong></div><div class="scenario-track"><span id="scenario-held-bar" style="width:33.3333%"></span></div></div>
      <div class="scenario-bar-row"><div><span>Remaining fare</span><strong id="scenario-fare">$12,321.75</strong></div><div class="scenario-track fare-track"><span id="scenario-fare-bar" style="width:50%"></span></div></div>
      <dl class="btc-model-details"><div><dt>BTC contributed upfront</dt><dd id="scenario-btc-deposit"></dd></div><div><dt>BTC held after reservation cost</dt><dd id="scenario-btc-held"></dd></div><div><dt>BTC price to cover the fare*</dt><dd id="scenario-break-even"></dd></div></dl><p class="scenario-scale">Both bars use the same scale, from $0 to <span id="scenario-maximum">$24,643.50</span>.</p>
      <div class="scenario-result" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><span id="scenario-result-label">Balance at Oct 1, 2027 · before taxes and fees</span><strong id="scenario-balance">$4,107.25</strong><p id="scenario-explanation">With no price change, you still owe 25% of the fare.</p></div>
    </figure>
    <p class="scenario-note" id="bitcoin-scenario-note">*Before taxes and fees. Illustration, not a forecast or a settlement quote. BTC quantities are rounded for display; calculations use the unrounded quantity. The deposit-date price determines how much BTC is held. Today’s spot price is only a planning reference. Assumes 25% of the fare is converted immediately from your initial contribution. Taxes and fees are excluded and may increase the amount due or reduce a refund. A 50% price rise covers the remaining fare before those deductions. A shortfall is due October 15, 2027.</p>
  </div>
</div><div class="payment-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">The payment plan</p><h3>20% now.<br>The journey ahead.</h3><p>Secure your spot with a <strong id="deposit-amount">$3,285.80</strong> deposit when reservations open.</p><ol class="payment-dates"><li><span>On reservation</span><strong>20% deposit</strong></li><li><span>January 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li><li><span>April 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li><li><span>July 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li><li><span>October 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li></ol><p class="fine">Five equal payments of 20%, including your reservation deposit.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">The bitcoin option · proposed</p><h3>Stay in bitcoin.<br>Settle before sailing.</h3><p>Contribute 75% of your berth price in bitcoin by December 1, 2026: <strong id="bitcoin-amount">$12,321.75</strong> in USD value for the selected berth.</p><p>From your contribution, 25% of the full berth price (<strong id="reservation-amount">$4,107.25</strong>) goes toward reserving your space. The remaining bitcoin, initially worth <strong id="held-amount">$8,214.50</strong>, is held until October 1, 2027.</p><p>On October 1, 2027, its value, less applicable tax on any gain, is applied against the remaining 75% of your fare (<strong id="balance-amount">$12,321.75</strong>). A surplus would be refunded to your account. Any remaining balance would be due October 15, 2027. Failure to pay would result in forfeiture of your spot.</p><p class="fine">Draft terms. Custody, valuation, tax calculation, and refund details must be confirmed before booking.</p></article></div><div class="booking-note"><strong>Reservations opening soon.</strong><span>Payment options are a preview. No deposit or payment is collected on this page.</span></div></section>
<section id="parka" class="parka section"><div class="parka-intro"><p class="eyebrow">05 / Wear the expedition</p><h2>A place on<br>the parka.</h2><p class="lede">Put your organization on the expedition’s signature layer.</p><p>Explore proposed patch locations. Placement dimensions, prices, and the final parka design will be announced before reservations open.</p><div class="view-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Parka view"><button type="button" data-parka-view="front" aria-pressed="true">Front</button><button type="button" data-parka-view="back" aria-pressed="false">Back</button></div></div><div class="parka-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 520 570" role="img" aria-labelledby="parka-title"><title id="parka-title">Concept illustration of the expedition parka</title><defs><linearGradient id="coat" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#d9a750"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9a692c"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke="#132e37" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"><path fill="#162e38" d="M198 103q-18-92 62-92t62 92l-30 38h-62z"/><path fill="#c99643" d="M198 103q-8-71 62-71t62 71l-35 30h-54z"/><path fill="url(#coat)" d="m195 99-70 35L53 327l65 30 54-118-6 285q94 33 188 0l-6-285 54 118 65-30-72-193-70-35-65 41z"/><path fill="#e8bd72" d="m195 99 65 41-43 30-28-60m136-11-65 41 43 30 28-60"/><path fill="none" d="M260 141v397M175 442h73v66h-73m97-66h73v66h-73M64 309l63 29m266 0 63-29M168 519q92 31 184 0"/></g><g class="parka-front" fill="#193b45" stroke="#ebd7a5" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4"><rect x="182" y="191" width="60" height="48" rx="4"/><rect x="278" y="191" width="60" height="48" rx="4"/><rect x="83" y="209" width="46" height="54" rx="4"/></g><g class="parka-back" hidden><path fill="#c99a4b" d="M185 172h150v270H185z"/><rect x="186" y="198" width="148" height="105" rx="4" fill="#193b45" stroke="#ebd7a5" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/></g></svg><div class="patch-hotspots parka-front"><button data-patch="chest-left" class="patch left" aria-label="Explore left chest sponsor patch">+</button><button data-patch="chest-right" class="patch right" aria-label="Explore right chest sponsor patch">+</button><button data-patch="sleeve" class="patch sleeve" aria-label="Explore sleeve sponsor patch">+</button></div><div class="patch-hotspots parka-back" hidden><button data-patch="back" class="patch back" aria-label="Explore back sponsor panel">+</button></div><small>Concept only / final garment and placements to be confirmed</small></div><aside class="patch-detail" aria-live="polite"><span class="eyebrow">Proposed placement</span><h3 id="patch-name">Left chest patch</h3><p id="patch-copy">A prominent placement on the front of the expedition parka.</p><dl><div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Not yet reservable</dd></div><div><dt>Dimensions</dt><dd>To be confirmed</dd></div><div><dt>Price</dt><dd>To be announced</dd></div></dl><a class="text-link" href="/sponsor">Ask about sponsorship ↗</a></aside></section>
<footer><a class="wordmark" href="/">bitcoin<span>++</span></a><p>Ideas worth travelling for.</p><a href="/dashboard">Existing attendee? Your account ↗</a></footer>
</main></body></html>
